  <!-- EN: {BASELABEL} chasing [../asker_nameDef] -->
  <OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.Delay.node.nodes.Util_Raid.parms.customLetterLabel.value.slateRef>追逐[../asker_nameDef]的{BASELABEL}</OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.Delay.node.nodes.Util_Raid.parms.customLetterLabel.value.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: {BASETEXT}\n              \nThe [enemyFaction_pawnsPlural] have come to get [../asker_nameDef]. -->
  <OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.Delay.node.nodes.Util_Raid.parms.customLetterText.value.slateRef>{BASETEXT}\n              \n[enemyFaction_pawnsPlural]已经前来抓捕[../asker_nameDef]。</OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.Delay.node.nodes.Util_Raid.parms.customLetterText.value.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: Should depart on shuttle -->
  <OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.ShuttleDelay.node.nodes.InspectString.inspectString.slateRef>应该乘坐穿梭机离开</OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.ShuttleDelay.node.nodes.InspectString.inspectString.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: Shuttle arrived -->
  <OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.ShuttleDelay.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>穿梭机已到达</OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.ShuttleDelay.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: The shuttle has arrived to collect [asker_nameDef]. -->
  <OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.ShuttleDelay.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>穿梭机已经到达来接[asker_nameDef]。</OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.ShuttleDelay.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: Guest died: {SUBJECT_definite} -->
  <OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.askerDestroyed.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>访客死亡：{SUBJECT_definite}</OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.askerDestroyed.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: {SUBJECT_definite}, who you were charged to protect, has died. [failLetterEndingCommon] -->
  <OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.askerDestroyed.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>你被指派保护的{SUBJECT_definite}已经死亡。[failLetterEndingCommon]</OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.askerDestroyed.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: Unauthorized surgery: {SUBJECT_definite} -->
  <OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.askerSurgeryViolation.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>未经授权的手术：{SUBJECT_definite}</OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.askerSurgeryViolation.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: Unauthorized, violating surgery has been performed on {SUBJECT_definite}, who you were charged to protect. Because of this violation, [asker_pronoun] will now attempt to leave. [failLetterEndingCommon] -->
  <OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.askerSurgeryViolation.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>对被指派保护的{SUBJECT_definite}进行了未经授权、违反规定的手术。由于这次违规行为，[asker_pronoun]现在将尝试离开。[failLetterEndingCommon]</OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.askerSurgeryViolation.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: Xenogerm absorbed: {SUBJECT_definite} -->
  <OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.askerXenogermAbsorbed.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>异种胚芽被吸收：{SUBJECT_definite}</OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.askerXenogermAbsorbed.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: {SUBJECT_definite}, who you were charged to protect, has had {SUBJECT_possessive} xenogerm forcibly absorbed. Because of this violation, {SUBJECT_pronoun} will now attempt to leave. [failLetterEndingCommon] -->
  <OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.askerXenogermAbsorbed.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>你被指派保护的{SUBJECT_definite}的{SUBJECT_possessive}异种胚芽被强行吸收。由于这次违规行为，{SUBJECT_pronoun}现在将尝试离开。[failLetterEndingCommon]</OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.askerXenogermAbsorbed.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: Captured: {SUBJECT_definite} -->
  <OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.askerArrested.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>被捕：{SUBJECT_definite}</OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.askerArrested.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: {SUBJECT_definite}, who you were charged to host, has been arrested. [failLetterEndingCommon] -->
  <OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.askerArrested.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>你被指派接待的{SUBJECT_definite}已被逮捕。[failLetterEndingCommon]</OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.askerArrested.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: Guest lost: {SUBJECT_definite} -->
  <OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.askerLeftMap.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>访客失踪：{SUBJECT_definite}</OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.askerLeftMap.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: {SUBJECT_definite}, who you were charged to protect, has left the designated settlement. [failLetterEndingCommon] -->
  <OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.askerLeftMap.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>你被指派保护的{SUBJECT_definite}已经离开了指定的定居点。[failLetterEndingCommon]</OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.askerLeftMap.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: Guest lost: {SUBJECT_definite} -->
  <OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.askerRanWild.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>访客失控：{SUBJECT_definite}</OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.askerRanWild.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: {SUBJECT_definite}, who you were charged to protect, has run wild. [failLetterEndingCommon] -->
  <OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.askerRanWild.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>你被指派保护的{SUBJECT_definite}已经失控。[failLetterEndingCommon]</OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.askerRanWild.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: Shuttle destroyed -->
  <OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.pickupShipThingDestroyed.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>穿梭机被摧毁</OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.pickupShipThingDestroyed.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: The shuttle sent to collect [asker_nameDef] has been destroyed. [asker_pronoun] will now leave on foot. [failLetterEndingCommon] -->
  <OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.pickupShipThingDestroyed.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>派来接[asker_nameDef]的穿梭机已被摧毁。[asker_pronoun]现在将步行离开。[failLetterEndingCommon]</OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.pickupShipThingDestroyed.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: Quest failed: [resolvedQuestName] -->
  <OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.pickupShipThingSentUnsatisfied.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>任务失败：[resolvedQuestName]</OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.pickupShipThingSentUnsatisfied.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: The shuttle sent to collect [asker_nameDef] has departed without [asker_objective]. [asker_pronoun] will now leave on foot. [failLetterEndingCommon] -->
  <OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.pickupShipThingSentUnsatisfied.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>派来接[asker_nameDef]的穿梭机已经离开了，但没有带上[asker_objective]。[asker_pronoun]现在将步行离开。[failLetterEndingCommon]</OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.pickupShipThingSentUnsatisfied.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>
  
